{"type":"message","id":"ceaa0be3","parentId":"d51f6c5c","timestamp":"2026-03-14T09:23:50.528Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 17:23 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为 Executor Subagent，执行公告抓取任务：\n\n## 目标\n从40个目标URL中随机选择3个网站，执行完整的公告抓取+页面结构分析\n\n## 步骤\n1. 读取目标列表：~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/targets.json\n2. 随机选3个不同的网站\n3. 对每个网站：\n   - 用 Playwright 访问\n   - 提取最新5条公告（标题+日期+链接）\n   - 分析页面结构（CSS选择器）\n4. 产出2个文件（都在 ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/output/日期/）：\n   - data/公告列表-2026-03-14.md\n   - data/页面结构分析-2026-03-14.md\n5. 把这两个md文件转成Word（.docx）放到 docs/ 目录\n6. 发送 Word 文件到飞书群：oc_00c2c690e5a60b6803a38b121568e4c1\n\n注意：如果某个URL访问失败，快速切换到备用URL（参考经验库的 url_pattern）"}],"timestamp":1773480230527}}
