{"type":"message","id":"fe4eb6df","parentId":"b344a4f6","timestamp":"2026-03-14T09:24:09.238Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我获取到了39个目标URL。现在需要随机选择3个不同的网站。让我用Python来随机选择3个。\n\n然后我需要：\n1. 用Playwright访问每个网站\n2. 提取最新5条公告\n3. 分析页面结构\n4. 产出2个文件\n5. 转换成Word\n6. 发送到飞书\n\n先让我创建输出目录并随机选择3个网站。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，有39个目标。现在随机选3个网站并创建输出目录。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_79b621846d004625a4d379de","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/output/2026-03-14/data ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/output/2026-03-14/docs"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773480237751}}
